      "maine_s_gulls_herring_great_black_back": "Maine's gulls — Herring, Great Black-backed, Ring-billed, Laughing, Bonaparte's, Iceland, Glaucous. Multiple-year plumages make gulls the hardest birding ID group. Adult winter + breeding + first-winter for each.",
      "maine_s_longest_citizen_science": "Maine's longest citizen science",
