      "after_each_class_write_a_5_sentence_re": "After each class, write a 5-sentence reflection. WHAT did you learn? WHAT confused you? WHAT do you want to investigate? DUE: ongoing.",
      "after_expending_ink_an_octopus_must_re": "After expending ink, an octopus must rebuild its ink supply over ~30 days — a process metabolically expensive enough that ink is treated as a finite anti-predator resource.",
