      "trinidad_guppies_have_vivid_spots_in_s": "Trinidad guppies have vivid spots in safe streams (mate choice wins) but dull spots in predator-rich streams (natural selection wins). Same species, different equilibria — exactly the dynamic the predator cost toggle models.",
      "true_but_evolution_is_still_real_for_s": "True — but evolution is still real for small changes",
