      "10_clinical_vignettes_identify_which_o": "10 clinical vignettes; identify which of 6 nutrients (vitamin D, iron, B12, folate, calcium, iodine) is most likely missing. Vignettes target the canonical real-world deficiency cases: Maine winter runner with stress fractures, menstruating teen with ADHD-like inattention, strict vegan with neuropathy, preconception folate, lactose-intolerant teen with low bone density, PPI-induced B12 deficiency.",
