      "drink_water_in_the_next_hour_not_an_em": "Drink water in the next hour. Not an emergency, but you are trending toward thirsty.",
      "dry_lips_and_dry_mouth_are_real_signal": "Dry lips and dry mouth are real signals — but skin \"tenting\" (slow snap-back) only shows up at moderate-to-severe dehydration.",
