      "ancient_medieval_2": "Ancient + medieval",
      "andrew_pettegree_brand_luther_how_an_u": "Andrew Pettegree, Brand Luther: How an Unheralded Monk Turned His Small Town into a Center of Publishing (2015)",
      "andrew_pettegree_the_book_in_the_renai": "Andrew Pettegree, \"The Book in the Renaissance\" (2010)",
      "andrew_pettegree_the_book_in_the_renai_2": "Andrew Pettegree, \"The Book in the Renaissance\" (2010)",
      "animal_farm_george_orwell": "Animal Farm (George Orwell)",
      "anna_a_17_year_old_baker_s_daughter_si": "Anna, a 17-year-old baker's daughter, signals interest in walking with you. But apprentices are forbidden to court or marry by guild rules. If caught, you lose 6 months of progress.",
