      "vinland_map_mark_hofmann_hitler_diarie": "Vinland Map, Mark Hofmann, Hitler Diaries, Konrad Kujau. The history of book + manuscript forgery + how forgers got caught.",
      "viral_social_post_2026": "Viral social post 2026",
