      "loading": "Loading Machine Lab...",
      "log_hint": "Try a very light stone and a very heavy one. The light one leaves faster but wastes most of the energy on the arm. Somewhere in between throws furthest.",
      "loose": "Loose!",
      "loosing": "Away!",
